 kit people - lists who has access to the repository, its teams, and the bots that acted

   one of
   *kit people*  lists who has access to the repository, its teams, and the bots that acted

     --text   --json   --jq
                           prints the stages as text, even on a terminal

   --stages    prints the stages, one per line, in order, the same over any workspace
   --marks     prints a mark per stage, as one JSON object: null for each, as each is read again
               only on Refresh, kittui offering no Watch for a tab kit never marks
   people      who has access to the repository, people and bots, each with a role
   teams       the teams with access, 20 at most, each with its members, 100 at most
   agents      the bots that acted in the repository's newest commits, changes, and reviews


 kit people
